WEBVTT

00:03:56.645 --> 00:04:00.149
he has migrated to the Gulf countries,

00:04:00.149 --> 00:04:02.844
to earn a living for his seven sisters

00:04:02.844 --> 00:04:05.192
and parents,

00:04:05.192 --> 00:04:11.046
because he thinks that it will be humiliating

00:04:11.046 --> 00:04:13.768
if his seven sisters learn a skill

00:04:13.768 --> 00:04:16.148
and they go out of the home

00:04:16.148 --> 00:04:20.299
and earn some livelihood.

00:04:20.299 --> 00:04:21.889
So this brother,

00:04:21.889 --> 00:04:25.242
he sacrifices the joys of his life

00:04:25.242 --> 00:04:28.634
and the happiness of his sisters

00:04:28.634 --> 00:04:33.218
at the altar of so-called honor.